DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       ppddff22ddsscc uses ggss(1) to read an Adobe PPoorrttaabbllee DDooccuummeenntt FFoorrmmaatt (PDF) doc‐
       ument "input.pdf" and create  a  PPoossttSSccrriipptt(tm)  document  "output.dsc"
       that  conforms  to  Adobe's  DDooccuummeenntt SSttrruuccttuurriinngg CCoonnvveennttiioonnss (DSC) re‐
